OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer's 'awe' at rare
OL,4,Aalbino stag encounter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer who captured on camera a
OL,7,Frare encounter with a white hart deer
OL,8,Fin the wilds of Devon said he felt
OL,9,F"awe" he felt coming within feet of it.
OL,11,FBrian Johnston, a lorry driver who
OL,12,Fphotographs wildlife in his spare time,
OL,13,Fsaid it was following a two-day mission
OL,14,Fthat he finally spotted the stag dozing
OL,15,Fin a field.
OL,17,F"It really is a spectacle to see this
OL,18,Fmythic-like creature - and to just to
OL,19,Fsee one sitting in a field is pretty
OL,20,Fspecial," he said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
