OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer's 'awe' at rare
OL,4,Aalbino stag encounter
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharles Smith-Jones, technical advisor
OL,7,Fat the British Deer Society, said,
OL,8,Fafter studying the photographs, that he
OL,9,Fbelieved the red deer to be
OL,10,F"albinistic" - which he said was "very
OL,11,Fvery unusual".
